The tooltip ("Select which product group you are looking for here.") was gated behind a `localStorage` flag set on first dismissal, so it never appeared again after the initial visit.

## Changes (`app.js` — `initGloveGroupTiles`)

- **Remove `localStorage` guard**: Drop `if (!localStorage.getItem('gloveGroupTooltipDismissed'))` so the tooltip is always created on page load.
- **Remove persistence on tile click**: Drop `localStorage.setItem('gloveGroupTooltipDismissed', 'true')` from the group tile click handler; keep `tooltip.remove()`.
- **Remove persistence on close**: Drop `localStorage.setItem('gloveGroupTooltipDismissed', 'true')` from the close button handler; keep `tooltip.remove()`.

```js
// Before — tooltip suppressed after first dismissal
if (!localStorage.getItem('gloveGroupTooltipDismissed')) {
  // ... create tooltip ...
  closeBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
    localStorage.setItem('gloveGroupTooltipDismissed', 'true');
    tooltip.remove();
  });
}

// After — always shown; dismissed only for the current view
const tooltip = document.createElement('div');
// ... create tooltip ...
closeBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
  tooltip.remove();
});
```

